==Trivia==
* It was speculated that Corki was inspired by https://liquipedia.net/dota2/Gyrocopter Aurel Vlaicu the Gyrocopter] from ''{{w|Dota 2}}''.
** This has been proven false given Corki was released on 19-Sep-2009 (patch [[V0.9.25.21]]) while Gyrocopter was released on 28-Jul-2010 for the original {{w|DotA}} custom map.
*** Yet both of them are most likely based on the [https://warcraft.wiki.gg/wiki/Gyrocopter Gyrocopter] from ''{{w|Warcraft III: Reign of Chaos}}'' (''{{w|Warcraft III: The Frozen Throne|Frozen Throne}}'''s name: [https://warcraft.wiki.gg/wiki/Flying_Machine_(Warcraft_III) Flying machine]).
* Corki was the first [[champion]] to have two {{skin tier|Legendary}} [[skins]] as well as the first to have three.
** All of them are old skins that are either Legacy or were never for sale to begin with.
* Corki's dance references the [https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=mv5qzMtLE60 "Do a barrel roll!"] phrase spoken by [https://starfoxwiki.info/wiki/Peppy_Hare Peppy Hare] in {{w|Star Fox 64}}.<ref>[https://knowyourmeme.com/memes/do-a-barrel-roll "Do a Barrel Roll" on KnowYourMeme]</ref>
** A side-by-side comparison can be seen [http://www.youtube.com/watch?v=FLT1xML9sW4 here].
* In the now-removed official League of Legends [https://web.archive.org/web/20130726165848/http://forums.na.leagueoflegends.com/board/ forums], the [[File:Missile_Barrage_old.png|20px]] original icon of {{ai|Missile Barrage|Corki}} was used to represent the "In-Game HUD Discussion" section.
* The [https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=0wkfuTTIYSQ old sound effect] for when Corki picks up {{ai|The Package|Corki}} was similar to an [https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=cURcd2_w-rg air raid siren], which was pointed out by a player in Syria.<ref>[https://www.reddit.com/r/leagueoflegends/comments/3slzir/corki_ult/ Reddit post regarding Package Delivery's air siren sound]</ref> It was promptly changed.<ref>[https://web.archive.org/web/20151116222425/http://boards.na.leagueoflegends.com/en/c/developer-corner/d0oKyxKw-corkis-special-delivery-sfx Boards Riot post on Corki's Special Delivery SFX]</ref>
* The skin Red Baron might be a reference to Manfred von Richthofen the Red Baron, a WWI German Ace who was known for flying a red Fokker Dr.I similar to Corki's aircraft in the splash art.

