* Brand is the second fire-themed champion, the first being {{ci|Annie}}.
** {{ais|Sear|Brand}} animation resembles {{cis|Annie}} basic attack one.
*** Brand's autoattack particle is the same as {{cis|Morgana}} but orange instead of purple.
* ''Brand'' comes from Proto-Germanic [https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/Reconstruction:Proto-Germanic/brandaz ''*brandaz''], meaning "fire, torch, sword".
** His host's given name ''{{w|Mac Aodhagáin|Kegan}}'' is likely based on Gaelic patronymic ''{{Tt|Mac|PIE *meh₂ḱ- to raise}} {{Tt|Aodhagáin|PIE *h₂eydʰ- to burn}}'', "son of {{w|Aed (god)|fire}}" by coincidence;<ref>Matasović, R. ''Etymological Dictionary of Proto-Celtic'', p. 51, 254-255</ref>
*** His surname ''Rodhe'' possibly from Old Norse ''{{Tt|hróðr|PIE *kerH- to praise}}'' "praise, renown".<ref>Kroonen, G. ''Etymological Dictionary of Proto-Germanic'', p. 249</ref>
** {{ai|Pyroclasm|Brand}} derives from ''pyroclastic'', a term used to describe fast-moving volcanic material, from Greek πῦρ "fire" & κλαστός "broken
**Brand musical reference comes from the hip-hop group called  '''Brand Nubian'''

