* Fiora's fighting style references {{w|Fencing}} while she herself might have been inspired by {{w|Julie d'Aubigny}}.<ref>[https://web.archive.org/web/0/http://na.leagueoflegends.com/board/showthread.php?p=21535737#post21535737 Morello on Fiora's origin]</ref>
