**Having become CEO years after, Laurent only discovered this ''easter egg'' during the production of ''[[Runeterra (Legends of Runeterra)|Legends of Runeterra]].''<ref> [https://open.spotify.com/episode/6RzbDHoxbYjeyBfBjCNwiM Interview with Nicolo Laurent by French media Konbini], November 2022</ref> 
